	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "68-pin Mini D Ribbon (MDR/SCSI-3), male, right-angle PCB mount. Rebuilt from MH drawing 3700-0121-01 rev 3.0 (2015-03-27): 0.85mm contact holes in 4 staggered rows of 17 at 1.905mm, 2.54mm within-row pitch on two 1.27mm phases, array 41.91mm wide, two 2.77mm non-plated mounting holes at 57.93mm centres. Replaces a version that drilled 0.5mm (pins do not fit) in 2 rows at 2.84mm. PIN MAP UNVERIFIED: the drawing does not state which contact numbers land in which tail row; this footprint assumes A_odd,A_even,B_odd,B_even (see gen_wl_sync_footprints.py's MDR68_TAIL_ORDER for the alternatives and hardware/breakout/d3-panel-thickness.md for how to close it). Confirm against MH's own drawing or 3D model before fab.")
	(tags "connector MDR SCSI-3 68pin right-angle PCB")
